In a recent game as a Wizard I managed to get quite experienced pets,
before reaching level 6. As I entered level 6 Skretzj my cat steps
on a polymorph trap and transforms into a human. Later I discover
a huge book store but my gold is under 0.1K so I'll have to rely
on my pets. To my astonishment my former-cat-but-now-human starts
kicking the shopkeeper's ass and believe me, he didn't stand a chance.
Some way to slay a shopkeeper (being a  non-chaotic!) and great fun to
watch as well...

